    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "** NB - Cash buyer only as this property was originally granted permission as a holiday home.**\r\n\r\nDowling property is delighted to present to the market this \"turn-key\" property for sale, in this highly sought after location. This spacious, ground floor apartment extends to c.98 sq.mt and has been completely upgraded and is presented in excellent condition.\r\n\r\nThe features list is impressive and includes 2 double bedrooms with master en-suite, separate kitchen and sitting room and a large covered outside patio area, which overlooks the landscaped grounds. The kitchen has been upgraded to include a modern kitchen with all appliances built in. Both the en-suite and main bathroom have also been upgraded to a very stylish fitout. The heating is gas and windows are upgraded.\r\n\r\nThis property would make a 1st class investment as the area has achieved high rental yields with the Luas just a 10 minute walk away. A turn-key investment awaits the lucky new owner of no.15. One not to be missed !!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation, which is extremely spacious consists of entrance hallway, kitchen, sitting/dining room, French doors to outside patio, family bathroom, 2 double bedrooms with master en-suite.\r\n\r\nAll amenities are on your doorstep, within walking distance to Saggart Village, which includes primary and secondary schools, shops and leisure activities City West shopping centre is a walk away where you'll also find the Luas stop."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Hallway - 5.43m x 1.03m \r\nA most welcoming hallway with wooden floor. Hotpress which is shelved for storage.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 2.14m x 2.55m \r\nA separate kitchen which has a modern fitted kitchen with built in oven and hob, dishwasher, fridge and washing machine. Tiled floor and back splash.\r\n\r\nSitting/Dining Room - 6.39m x 4.37m \r\nThis well proportioned room is a real highlight and enjoys very pleasant views to front. Wooden floors, ornate ceiling coving, attractive feature fireplace. Dining area. French doors leading to outside patio area.\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.73m x 1.6m \r\nA generous sized family bathroom which has been recently renovated and features step in rain shower, tastefully tiled floor and walls, sink unit with built in storage, wall mounted mirror with storage and W.C.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.75m x 3.2m \r\nSpacious double bedroom with built in wardrobes. Wooden floors.\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom - 4.47m x 3.37m \r\nThis large master bedroom is another real highlight and has built in wardrobes. Wooden floor. \r\n\r\nEn-suite - 1.9m x 2.0m \r\nA generous sized en-suite which has recently been renovated and features a bath, W.C and W.H.B with storage, wall mounted mirror with storage, tiled floor and walls.\r\n\r\nOutside patio area - \r\nA welcome addition to any home is this covered patio area which is accessed via French doors and overlooks landscaped green area.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Very Good Condition Throughout\r\n2 Double Bedrooms\r\nSeparate Kitchen and Sitting Room\r\nGas Heating\r\nMaster Bed En-suite\r\nAccom Exts c.98 sq.mt\r\nDouble Glazed windows\r\nFrench Doors to Outside Patio Area\r\nWalking Distance to Luas\r\nVery Pleasant Views to Front\r\nApartment Has Been Completely Upgraded"
      },
      {
